[I] Converts HTML files into indexed HTML, Adobe PostScript, or Adobe PDF files

[T] HTMLDOC supports most HTML 3.2 elements, some HTML 4.0 elements, and can
[T] generate title and table of contents pages.
[T] HTMLDOC can be used as a standalone application, in a batch document
[T] processing environment, or as a web-based report generation application.

[U] https://www.htmldoc.org

